                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Turkey and the United States on August 16, 1951, in an exchange of notes, amended
                    the Economic Cooperation Agreement of July 4, 1948, as previously amended. For
                    the texts of these notes which entered into force upon signature, see TIAS No.
                    2392, printed in 3 UST (pt. 1) 54.</p>
            </div>
